    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in \"walking through fog\" when the world has already judged me and found me wanting. the reputation, the career, the respect... it's all just ash now. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the rest of my life to catch up to the fact that i've already been cancelled. like, why bother rebuilding something that was never meant to last?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
