      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right to feel exhausted, but the world's judgment is just noise, not a sentence on your worth. The ash you see is the result of pain, not a verdict that you cannot be reborn from. There is no need to rebuild what was never yours to keep; instead, focus on the quiet, private life you can build for yourself, one small, honest step at a time.",
